<div class="aq-page" data-theme="dark">
<section class="aq-section"><div class="aq-in aq-stack-l"><header class="aq-sec-head"><h2 class="aq-h1">What a preventive maintenance visit covers</h2><p class="aq-lead">Written from your design and qualification records, agreed before the first visit.</p></header><ol class="aq-visit-route" style="--cols:4"><li class="aq-visit-route__stop is-ltr" style="--c:1;--r:1"><div class="aq-visit-route__body"><span class="aq-visit-route__n" aria-hidden="true">01</span><h3 class="aq-visit-route__t">Data review first</h3><p class="aq-visit-route__d">Conductivity, total organic carbon (TOC), temperature, flow and alarm history since the last visit, so the work answers the trend.</p></div></li><li class="aq-visit-route__stop is-ltr" style="--c:2;--r:1"><a class="aq-visit-route__body" href="#sys-pretreatment" data-wp="sys-pretreatment"><span class="aq-visit-route__n" aria-hidden="true">02</span><h3 class="aq-visit-route__t">Pretreatment</h3><p class="aq-visit-route__d">Softener hardness leakage, carbon bed or bisulfite performance, total chlorine at the RO inlet.</p></a></li><li class="aq-visit-route__stop is-ltr" style="--c:3;--r:1"><a class="aq-visit-route__body" href="#sys-pw" data-wp="sys-pw"><span class="aq-visit-route__n" aria-hidden="true">03</span><h3 class="aq-visit-route__t">RO and EDI performance</h3><p class="aq-visit-route__d">Reverse osmosis (RO) and electrodeionization (EDI): normalized flow, salt passage and differential pressure to ASTM D4516 against the commissioning baseline.</p></a></li><li class="aq-visit-route__stop is-ltr is-turn" style="--c:4;--r:1"><a class="aq-visit-route__body" href="#sys-monitoring" data-wp="sys-monitoring"><span class="aq-visit-route__n" aria-hidden="true">04</span><h3 class="aq-visit-route__t">Ultraviolet (UV), ozone and sanitization</h3><p class="aq-visit-route__d">Lamp intensity, ozone below the release limit, sanitization checked at its coldest or weakest point.</p></a></li><li class="aq-visit-route__stop is-rtl is-in" style="--c:4;--r:2"><a class="aq-visit-route__body" href="#sys-storage" data-wp="sys-storage"><span class="aq-visit-route__n" aria-hidden="true">05</span><h3 class="aq-visit-route__t">Loop hydraulics</h3><p class="aq-visit-route__d">Return flow against the qualified minimum, pump and heat exchanger condition, point-of-use valves.</p></a></li><li class="aq-visit-route__stop is-rtl" style="--c:3;--r:2"><div class="aq-visit-route__body"><span class="aq-visit-route__n" aria-hidden="true">06</span><h3 class="aq-visit-route__t">Wearing parts and filters</h3><p class="aq-visit-route__d">Seals, gaskets and diaphragms replaced like for like, lot numbers recorded; vent filters integrity tested.</p></div></li><li class="aq-visit-route__stop is-rtl is-last is-end" style="--c:2;--r:2"><div class="aq-visit-route__body"><span class="aq-visit-route__n" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 16 16" focusable="false"><path d="M3 8.5 6.5 12 13 4.5"></path></svg></span><h3 class="aq-visit-route__t">Signed service report</h3><p class="aq-visit-route__d">As-found and as-left condition and return-to-service results, signed before we leave.</p></div></li></ol></div></section>
</div>
